===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|Toluin|lang=de}}, from {{term|Tolu|lang=de}} where it was first distilled.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|organic compound|lang=en}} A [[colourless]], [[inflammable]] [[liquid]] [[hydrocarbon]], [[methyl]][[benzene]], CH<sub>3</sub>.C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>, used as a [[solvent]], in [[high-octane]] [[fuel]]s and in the production of many [[chemical]] [[compound]]s.

